The staging preview (project nuovasolution-staging-preview) does not build while this file exists.

Audit order R10b (2026-10-03): the new home page is decided by the owner on the DESIGN preview and is
"not to be transferred to staging or production before the owner releases the preview". Both preview
projects build from this branch on every push, so vercel.json skips the build of the staging project
(NUOVA_INTEGRATION_MODE=staging) for as long as this file is in the repository. The staging preview
keeps serving the last deployment before the hold (commit 486bfe8, application code cf6e80f).

Release: delete this file in the commit that follows the owner's decision. Nothing else changes.
